# Plan 31 · MU0: an island route, written for this test alone and for no place of the game. Original: no melody,
# recording or sequence taken from anything. Rendered in the DS sound and in the modern one by tools/MusicRender
# (--sound ds|modern), so the same notes on the same instruments can be heard both ways.
title Island Route (MU0 test)
tempo 104
meter 4/4
reverb 0.28
nighttempo 0.9
lowhptempo 1.12
sound modern
room hall 1.8

# The tune: steel drum by day, vibraphone by night, a sharper lead in the red
track melody steeldrum night=vibraphone lowhp=pulse vol=0.62 pan=0.08 rev=0.32
  r1 | r1 |
  L v104 o5 a4 o6 c8 o5 v84 a8 v100 g4 f4 | o5 f4. v80 d8 v100 c4 d4 | o5 d4 v84 f8 d8 v100 c4 o4 b-4 | o5 c2 r4 v80 g8 a8 |
  v108 o5 a4 o6 v86 c8 o5 a8 v104 o6 c4 d4 | o5 e4. v82 c8 v100 o4 a4 o5 c4 | o5 d4 o4 v84 b-8 o5 d8 v100 f4 d4 | o5 e4 v84 d8 c8 v100 c2 |
  v110 o5 f2 d4 f4 | o5 g2 e4 g4 | o5 a4. v84 g8 v100 e4 c4 | o5 d2 f4 a4 |
  v108 o5 b-4. v84 a8 v100 g4 f4 | o5 g2 e4 c4 | v104 o5 f4 a8 v84 g8 v100 a4 o6 c4 | o5 g2. r4 |

# The strum: a down, two quick ones and a lift, every bar
track uke ukulele night=harp vol=0.25 pan=-0.3 rev=0.25
  o4 (f a > c)4 (f a > c)8 (f a > c)8 r8 (f a > c)8 (f a > c)4 | (e g > c)4 (e g > c)8 (e g > c)8 r8 (e g > c)8 (e g > c)4 |
  L
  (f a > c)4 (f a > c)8 (f a > c)8 r8 (f a > c)8 (f a > c)4 | (d f a > c)4 (d f a > c)8 (d f a > c)8 r8 (d f a > c)8 (d f a > c)4 |
  (f b- > d)4 (f b- > d)8 (f b- > d)8 r8 (f b- > d)8 (f b- > d)4 | (e g > c)4 (e g > c)8 (e g > c)8 r8 (e g > c)8 (e g > c)4 |
  (f a > c)4 (f a > c)8 (f a > c)8 r8 (f a > c)8 (f a > c)4 | (e a > c)4 (e a > c)8 (e a > c)8 r8 (e a > c)8 (e a > c)4 |
  (f b- > d)4 (f b- > d)8 (f b- > d)8 r8 (f b- > d)8 (f b- > d)4 | (e g > c)4 (e g > c)8 (e g > c)8 r8 (e g > c)8 (e g > c)4 |
  (f b- > d)4 (f b- > d)8 (f b- > d)8 r8 (f b- > d)8 (f b- > d)4 | (e g > c)4 (e g > c)8 (e g > c)8 r8 (e g > c)8 (e g > c)4 |
  (e a > c)4 (e a > c)8 (e a > c)8 r8 (e a > c)8 (e a > c)4 | (d f a)4 (d f a)8 (d f a)8 r8 (d f a)8 (d f a)4 |
  (f g b- > d)4 (f g b- > d)8 (f g b- > d)8 r8 (f g b- > d)8 (f g b- > d)4 | (e g > c)4 (e g > c)8 (e g > c)8 r8 (e g > c)8 (e g > c)4 |
